Lichii guest thread statistics: EDEN_NX2_GUEST_THREAD_STATS_SLOW_MS=<ms> (with EDEN_NX2_GUEST_THREAD_STATS=1) makes each
report window one present-to-present interval and logs only windows at least that long.
Against the pinned Lichii tree (versions.lock).

